# Drop the on-device storage stack: the FAT partition, the generic file-transfer
# service, the FlashDB key-value store and the durable event queue. Roughly 50 KB
# of flash, which a size-constrained app (the LVGL `ui_demo`, whose image is
# dominated by LVGL) can spend elsewhere.

CONFIG_HELIX_STORAGE_FAT=n
CONFIG_HELIX_FILE_TRANSFER=n
CONFIG_HELIX_DB=n
CONFIG_HELIX_EVENT_QUEUE=n
